 ring the kids to. The restaurant rebranded from Rick's Crab Trap to Rick'
 s Seafood and Sports.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Destin & Fort Walton\nTimes: Tu
 esday 8/25 · 6:00 PM\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-disney-triv
 ia-night-0825.html
